diff --git a/doc-build/md066.md b/doc-build/md066.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..c00d4165
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc-build/md066.md
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+This rule is triggered when an ATX style heading has no text:
+
+```markdown
+# Title
+
+##
+
+## #
+```
+
+To fix this, add text to the heading or remove it:
+
+```markdown
+# Title
+
+## Section
+```
+
+Rationale: An empty heading adds nothing to the document's structure and
+creates a meaningless entry in any table of contents.
